#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:5
#: 0cce4c459bb341c9ad818f1c65a9bff7
msgid "BLHeli32,AM32, and BLHeli_S ESCs"
msgstr "BLHeli32、AM32 和 BLHeli_S ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:7
#: 672bd5a10f1b4f1aa1452b2d8b13c1c8
msgid ""
"if you are using BLHeli32 ESCs, be sure to update to the latest "
"BLHeliSuite32 Rev32.10.0.0 firmware, to avoid surprise uncontrollable motor "
"starts due to a BLHel32 firmware bug!"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 BLHeli32 ESC，请务必更新到最新的 BLHeliSuite32 Rev32.10.0.0 固件，以避免因 BLHel32 固件 "
"bug 导致意外的不可控电机启动！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:9
#: adea4a48e4b347c19d82afe6f3e319d3
msgid ""
"The BLHeli firmware and configuration applications were developed to allow "
"the configuration of ESCs and provide additional features. ESCs with this "
"firmware allow configuring timing, motor direction, LEDs, motor drive "
"frequency, etc.  Before attempting to use BLHeli please follow the "
":ref:`DShot setup instructions <common-dshot-escs>`."
msgstr ""
"BLHeli 固件和配置应用程序的开发旨在允许配置 ESC 并提供附加功能。搭载此固件的 ESC 允许配置时序、电机方向、LED、电机驱动频率等。使用 "
"BLHeli 之前，请先按照 :ref:`DShot 设置说明 <common-dshot-escs>` 进行操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:11
#: 23c70246976c4fd1abfbbd1d1ecabc0d
msgid ""
"Depending on the ESC, BLHeli/BLHeli_S/BLHeli32/AM32 provides the following "
"features:"
msgstr "根据 ESC 的不同，BLHeli/BLHeli_S/BLHeli32/AM32 提供以下功能："

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:13
#: a147285b346b4e139c26629ef97397f9
msgid ""
"Pass-Through support in ArduPilot allows the BLHeliSuite, AM32 and other ESC"
" configurators to be used to configure the ESCs while remaining connected to"
" the autopilot via USB cable."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中的直通支持允许在 ESC 仍通过 USB 线缆连接到飞控的情况下，使用 BLHeliSuite、AM32 及其他 ESC "
"配置工具对 ESC 进行配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:14
#: 4f966a81ceac4dc5ba70ed19d1d347fc
msgid ""
":ref:`Reversible DShot <blheli32-reversible-dshot>` (aka 3D mode) allows the"
" motor to be spun in either direction"
msgstr ":ref:`可逆 DShot <blheli32-reversible-dshot>`（又称 3D 模式）允许电机在两个方向上旋转"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:15
#: 74d2b897e6d04da2b2990af977c8bf05
msgid ""
":ref:`Bi-directional DShot <bidir-dshot>` allows the ESCs to send RPM back "
"to the autopilot without the need for an additional telemetry connection"
msgstr ":ref:`双向 DShot <bidir-dshot>` 允许 ESC 将转速回传给飞控，无需额外的数传连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:16
#: 0b1c42afc17d49e297983fbc5d098a9e
msgid ""
":ref:`ESC Telemetry <blheli32-esc-telemetry>` allows the ESCs to send RPM, "
"voltage and current information back to the autopilot so that it can be "
"logged, viewed in real-time or even allow the removal of a :ref:`battery "
"monitor <esc-telemetry-based-battery-monitor>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ESC 数传 <blheli32-esc-telemetry>` 允许 ESC "
"将转速、电压和电流信息回传给飞控，以便记录、实时查看，甚至可以取代 :ref:`电池监测器 <esc-telemetry-based-battery-"
"monitor>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:18
#: 2c27236d638c4c1e8ba4195619372dc1
msgid ""
"\"BLHeli\" (and now AM32) covers multiple (sometimes competing) projects "
"providing ESCs firmware and accompanying configuration software"
msgstr "「BLHeli」（现在还有 AM32）涵盖多个（有时相互竞争的）提供 ESC 固件及配套配置软件的项目"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:20
#: d0d8885cdc7b441e9fc2b86b266ce9db
msgid ""
"BLHeli was the original open source software that is no longer maintained "
"and is not available on modern ESCs"
msgstr "BLHeli 是最初的开源软件，已不再维护，现代 ESC 上不再可用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:21
#: 1fcb6c88178b44da8cf1235563d403b3
msgid ""
"BLHeli32is closed source and based on 32bit ARM MCUs and development and "
"licensing was terminated in 2024.  All modern BLHeli ESCs use BLHeli32 but "
"will be replaced with AM32 in the future."
msgstr ""
"BLHeli32 是基于 32 位 ARM MCU 的闭源软件，开发和授权已于 2024 年终止。所有现代 BLHeli ESC 均使用 "
"BLHeli32，但未来将被 AM32 取代。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:22
#: a58574c70c6648b1b106c3186d5590cd
msgid ""
"`AM32 <https://am32.ca>`__ is open source with the same features as BLHeli32"
" before it became unavailable for new designs but continues to evolve."
msgstr "`AM32 <https://am32.ca>`__ 是开源软件，具有 BLHeli32 停止供应新设计前的相同功能，并持续发展。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:23
#: d91b38846bfb4bad9c3e4249527afcbb
msgid ""
"`BLHeli_S <https://github.com/bitdump/BLHeli>`__ is open source and 16bit.  "
"This is no longer actively maintained but the last published version, 16.7, "
"is installed by default on \"BLHeli_S\" ESCs when shipped from the factory"
msgstr ""
"`BLHeli_S <https://github.com/bitdump/BLHeli>`__ 是开源的 16 "
"位软件。已不再活跃维护，但最后发布的版本 16.7 仍是出厂时「BLHeli_S」ESC 的默认固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:24
#: e1774ea319a446acbdfc01095e8fec70
msgid ""
"`BLHeli_S JESC <https://jflight.net>`__ is paid, closed source software and "
"16bit allowing it to run on lower end hardware"
msgstr "`BLHeli_S JESC <https://jflight.net>`__ 是付费闭源软件，16 位，可在低端硬件上运行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:25
#: 9e8a987ccc57471e8472b919e20550d6
msgid ""
"`BLHeli_S BlueJay <https://github.com/mathiasvr/bluejay>`__ is free, open "
"source software and 16bit"
msgstr ""
"`BLHeli_S BlueJay <https://github.com/mathiasvr/bluejay>`__ 是免费开源软件，16 位"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:26
#: 45d55d36cb334e348496d146755cd1ba
msgid ""
"`Web-based ESC Configurator for the above <https://esc-configurator.com/>`__"
"  (due to timing variations, being internet based, reliability of connection"
" thru ArduPilot is variable)."
msgstr ""
"`上述软件的基于 Web 的 ESC 配置器 <https://esc-configurator.com/>`__（由于时序变化，基于互联网的方式，通过"
" ArduPilot 连接的可靠性不稳定）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:28
#: 87fb1df96d244961bf89962149bbf589
msgid "firmware 4.5 or later required to use this ESC Configurator tool."
msgstr "使用此 ESC 配置工具需要固件版本 4.5 或更高版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:31
#: cf743dacb6c940ceb9a6729dc0de50be
msgid "Pass-Through Support"
msgstr "直通支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:34
#: 641251f87ec141b5b3450c7a276ee3b9
msgid ""
"This feature is only available on NON IOMCU outputs. Autopilots which have "
"an IOMCU co-processsor (usually marked as having \"MAIN\" outputs from the "
"IOMCU and \"AUX\" outputs from the main cpu) will not pass-through on those "
"outputs. Use this feature on \"AUX\" or \"FMU\" outputs with DShot "
"capability. For Plane, Rover and Sub, be mindful that using AUX outputs for "
"vehicle-critical controls removes the benefits of an IOMCU. For Copter, "
"IOMCU redundancy is not effective since it has no \"MANUAL\" control mode. "
"For maximum robustness (on Plane which has a manual mode which can be used "
"if the FMU fails), switch your motors to \"AUX\" or \"FMU\" only when "
"configuring with passthrough, and move them back to \"MAIN\" once "
"configuration is complete."
msgstr ""
"此功能仅在非 IOMCU 输出上可用。具有 IOMCU 协处理器的飞控（通常标记为 IOMCU 提供「MAIN」输出，主 CPU "
"提供「AUX」输出）不支持在这些输出上直通。请在具有 DShot 功能的「AUX」或「FMU」输出上使用此功能。对于 Plane、Rover 和 "
"Sub，请注意将 AUX 输出用于飞行关键控制会失去 IOMCU 的冗余优势。对于 Copter，IOMCU "
"冗余无效，因为没有「手动」控制模式。为了最大健壮性（对于有手动模式的 Plane，在 FMU "
"故障时可使用手动模式），仅在使用直通配置时将电机切换到「AUX」或「FMU」，配置完成后再切换回「MAIN」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:38
#: cffe7d43db6f4294b59865958255314c
msgid ""
"The Pass-Through feature allows BLHeli32, AM32, and BLHeli_S ESCs to be "
"upgraded and configured using the corresponding BLHeliSuite32, AM32 "
"Configurator, or BLHeliSuite application (running on the user's PC) while "
"the ESCs remain connected to the autopilot.  To use this feature please "
"follow these steps"
msgstr ""
"直通功能允许在 ESC 仍连接到飞控的情况下，使用相应的 BLHeliSuite32、AM32 配置器或 BLHeliSuite 应用程序（在用户 PC"
" 上运行）对 BLHeli32、AM32 和 BLHeli_S ESC 进行升级和配置。请按以下步骤使用此功能："

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:40
#: a09781b2f9194ae6a61eac9d3b93f034
msgid ""
"Download and install `Linux or Windows AM32 configurator "
"<https://am32.ca/downloads>`__ (for use with AM32 ESCs), `BLHeliSuite32 "
"<https://github.com/bitdump/BLHeli/releases>`__ (for use with BLHeli32/AM32 "
"ESCs), `BLHeliSuite <https://github.com/bitdump/BLHeli>`__ (for BLHeli_S "
"ESC) or `JESC configurator <https://github.com/jflight-public/jesc-"
"configurator/releases>`__ (for use with BLHeli_S JESC) on your PC."
msgstr ""
"在 PC 上下载并安装 `Linux 或 Windows AM32 配置器 <https://am32.ca/downloads>`__（用于 AM32"
" ESC）、`BLHeliSuite32 <https://github.com/bitdump/BLHeli/releases>`__（用于 "
"BLHeli32/AM32 ESC）、`BLHeliSuite <https://github.com/bitdump/BLHeli>`__（用于 "
"BLHeli_S ESC）或 `JESC 配置器 <https://github.com/jflight-public/jesc-"
"configurator/releases>`__（用于 BLHeli_S JESC）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:41
#: 50e0484d0b32488594aef232f2bbc8e7
msgid ""
"Connect your PC to the autopilot using a USB cable and then connect with a "
"ground station (e.g. Mission Planner, QGC)."
msgstr "用 USB 线缆将 PC 连接到飞控，然后连接地面站（如 Mission Planner、QGC）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:42
#: 7b563994def74300b11ec28f3a98d735
msgid "Disconnect your propellers"
msgstr "拆下螺旋桨"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:43
#: 33f9b3e54db247a38f823b4f33833f00
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERVO_BLH_AUTO <SERVO_BLH_AUTO>` to 1 to automatically enable "
"pass-through on all outputs configured as motors (e.g. :ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION"
" <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` = \"Motor1\", \"Motor2\", etc) for multicopters and "
"quadplanes or throttle (e.g. those with :ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION "
"<SERVO9_FUNCTION>` set to 70 (\"throttle\"), 73 (\"throttle left\") or 74 "
"(\"throttle right\")) on rovers.  For most multicopters, quadplanes and "
"rovers this will do the right thing but for planes, set :ref:`SERVO_BLH_MASK"
" <SERVO_BLH_MASK>` to enable pass-through on the appropriate servo outputs."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SERVO_BLH_AUTO <SERVO_BLH_AUTO>` 设为 1，以自动在所有配置为电机的输出（如 "
":ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` = "
"「Motor1」、「Motor2」等）上为多旋翼和四旋翼固定翼启用直通，或在油门输出（如 :ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION "
"<SERVO9_FUNCTION>` 设为 70（「油门」）、73（「左油门」）或 74（「右油门」））上为 Rover "
"启用直通。对于大多数多旋翼、四旋翼固定翼和 Rover，这会自动正确处理；对于 Plane，请设置 :ref:`SERVO_BLH_MASK "
"<SERVO_BLH_MASK>` 以在适当的舵机输出上启用直通。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:44
#: bc8a1132ed2645d2b2882796f97f15a5
msgid ""
"If your PC is connected to the autopilot using a telemetry radio (instead of"
" using USB cable as recommended above) set :ref:`SERVO_BLH_PORT "
"<SERVO_BLH_PORT>` to the autopilot port connected to the telemetry radio.  "
"Beware that this is does NOT specify the port used for :ref:`ESC telemetry "
"<blheli32-esc-telemetry>` feedback to your autopilot!"
msgstr ""
"如果 PC 通过数传电台（而非建议的 USB 线缆）连接到飞控，请将 :ref:`SERVO_BLH_PORT <SERVO_BLH_PORT>` "
"设置为连接数传电台的飞控端口。注意，这并非指定用于 :ref:`ESC 数传 <blheli32-esc-telemetry>` 回传给飞控的端口！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:45
#: 112f354c25dc48218d5246ed0907b93e
msgid "Plug in the vehicle's battery to power the ESC's"
msgstr "插入飞行器电池为 ESC 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:46
#: 1bf9079fe27744b48b604a5f949d1907
msgid ""
"If using a safety switch ensure it is pushed (or disabled by setting "
":ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT <BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` = 0).  (``BRD_SAFETYENABLE`` in "
"older firmware versions)"
msgstr ""
"如果使用安全开关，请确保按下（或通过设置 :ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT <BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` = 0 "
"禁用）。（旧版固件中为 ``BRD_SAFETYENABLE``）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:47
#: 70b23a7698ed4360a9aa508455c0d381
msgid "Disconnect the ground station (but leave the USB cable connected)"
msgstr "断开地面站连接（但保持 USB 线缆连接）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:48
#: 16283b1ac1024c759364bd06d0526c8d
msgid ""
"Start the ESC configuration software and connect to the autopilot's COM port"
" by selecting \"BLHeli32/AM32 Bootloader (Betaflight/Cleanflight)\" from the"
" interfaces menu.  Press \"Connect\" and \"Read Setup\".  You should be able"
" to upgrade and configure all connected ESCs"
msgstr ""
"启动 ESC 配置软件，从接口菜单中选择 「BLHeli32/AM32 Bootloader "
"(Betaflight/Cleanflight)」连接到飞控的 COM 端口。按 「连接」和 「读取设置」。您应该能够升级和配置所有已连接的 ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:55
#: db566416382d49779e48387166eb4b8d
msgid ""
"ArduPilot firmware supports the pass-through protocol with up-to-date "
"BLHeli32, AM32 firmware and BLHeliSuite32, or BLHeli_S firmware and "
"BLHeliSuite only."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 固件仅支持最新版 BLHeli32、AM32 固件和 BLHeliSuite32，或 BLHeli_S 固件和 "
"BLHeliSuite 的直通协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:58
#: 06db17ecb5264f448132b04fc26186e8
msgid ""
"For pass-through to function, the autopilot must be configured to use one of"
" the DShot protocols.  If you wish to eventually use one of the other "
"protocols (e.g. PWM, OneShot125) that the ESC supports, you may still "
"configure the ESCs using Pass-Through (e.g. change motor directions, set "
"min/max values, etc) but then finally re-configure the autopilot to *not* "
"use DShot.  Once the autopilot and ESCs are rebooted the ESC should auto-"
"detect that the ESCs are no longer using DShot."
msgstr ""
"要使直通功能正常工作，飞控必须配置为使用 DShot 协议之一。如果最终希望使用 ESC 支持的其他协议（如 "
"PWM、OneShot125），仍可使用直通进行配置（如更改电机方向、设置最小/最大值等），但最后需要将飞控重新配置为不使用 DShot。飞控和 ESC"
" 重启后，ESC 应能自动检测到不再使用 DShot。"
